Refactored the SQL semantic model to remove duplicated traversal logic and added a regression test around the path-walk behavior.

- `SQLQueryModel` now builds the node path once and reuses it in both `findNodeContaining` and `findLexicalContext`, which makes the control flow easier to follow and keeps the deepest-node logic in one place: [SQLQueryModel.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G001_dbeaver/plugins/org.jkiss.dbeaver.model.sql/src/org/jkiss/dbeaver/model/sql/semantics/model/SQLQueryModel.java#L95), [SQLQueryModel.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G001_dbeaver/plugins/org.jkiss.dbeaver.model.sql/src/org/jkiss/dbeaver/model/sql/semantics/model/SQLQueryModel.java#L110), [SQLQueryModel.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G001_dbeaver/plugins/org.jkiss.dbeaver.model.sql/src/org/jkiss/dbeaver/model/sql/semantics/model/SQLQueryModel.java#L161)
- Added a focused unit test that covers deepest-node resolution, lexical scope item lookup, and tail-origin fallback past the end of the query: [SQLQueryModelContextTest.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G001_dbeaver/test/org.jkiss.dbeaver.model.sql.test/src/org/jkiss/dbeaver/model/sql/semantics/model/SQLQueryModelContextTest.java#L37), [SQLQueryModelContextTest.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G001_dbeaver/test/org.jkiss.dbeaver.model.sql.test/src/org/jkiss/dbeaver/model/sql/semantics/model/SQLQueryModelContextTest.java#L75)
- Updated the SQL test bundle dependencies so the new test can compile against the SQL model and STM types: [MANIFEST.MF](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G001_dbeaver/test/org.jkiss.dbeaver.model.sql.test/META-INF/MANIFEST.MF#L11)

